-- Open-world skilling areas: OSRS-style mines and tree groves spread across the overworld by
-- level, plus a furnace at the coal field. Generated by scripts/build-skilling-world-sql.mjs from
-- skilling-areas.js (placed by scripts/plan-skilling-areas.mjs on walkable, dry, level ground away
-- from roads, towns, buildings, water and other objects; tests/skilling-world.test.js).
--
-- Apply after db/professions-world.sql (any later order is fine). Idempotent and owner-safe:
--  * every node has a fixed id; a row that already exists (moved, edited or removed in World
--    Studio, deleted rows included) is never touched again, so owner edits survive a re-run;
--  * nodes go in through eldervale_private.entities, so the entity_runtime trigger creates the
--    realm objects (kind rock / tree / furnace) the gathering engine mines, chops and respawns;
--  * before inserting, each node's spot is checked against the live world (doors, other objects,
--    the walk check); a blocked spot is nudged up to 6 m, or skipped with a notice;
--  * the starter trail's "Mithril / Adamantite / Runite rocks" take their Eldervale names
--    (Moonsilver / Verdite / Tidestone) only while the owner has not renamed them.
-- Areas (centre x, z; nodes):
--  Birchford copper & tin mine (-299, 17; 7): Starter mine north-west of Birchford, by the Thornwood edge spiders (combat 5).
--  Birchford woodlot (-161, 233; 7): Normal and oak trees south of Birchford’s walls.
--  Kingsroad oak grove (-262, -226; 6): Normal and oak trees on the meadows south-east of the castle (rats and goblins, combat 2–4).
--  Riverbank willows (-97, 22; 5): Willows on the south bank of the river north-east of Birchford, by the balance-log crossing.
--  Cairnhill iron mine (44, -168; 6): Iron in the foothills of the Frostbound highlands, between Cairn hollow and Frostfang pass (combat 13–26).
--  Highmoor coal field (118, -209; 7): Coal on the high moor below Frostfang pass (combat 19–26), with a furnace.
--  Sunscar silver & gold mine (118, 193; 6): Silver and gold in the Amber Expanse near the Sandscar hideout (combat 22–25).
--  Amberleaf maple grove (37, 257; 5): Maples on the southern uplands between the Brigand thicket and the Cinderwing roost (combat 15–18).
--  Hermit’s yew grove (-396, -127; 4): A quiet stand of yews on the far western edge, away from roads and monsters.
--  Cragmaw moonsilver mine (372, -117; 4): Moonsilver under the Cragmaw heights, home of the ogres (combat 46).
--  Rimeback verdite ridge (336, -271; 3): Verdite on the frozen ridge above the Rimeback crags (trolls and wraiths, combat 33–36).
--  Blighted tidestone outcrop (-131, -396; 2): Two tidestone rocks on the northern edge between the Hollowmere cairns and the Blighted Reach (cairn knights, phantoms and dread knights, combat 34–105).
do $$declare row jsonb;d jsonb;rev bigint;bx float8;bz float8;dx float8;dz float8;ok boolean;i integer;added integer:=0;begin
